  "description": "Top tier gangster! Top tier Alpha! Baek Pil-Seung. A foolish gangster who can't resist anything cute?! He fell for the prickly Maltese Nam Woo-Yoon, who is clueless about the ways of the world. Woo-Yoon, an Omega without a proper registration, learns that his only brother has died and goes to find him, but his life takes a drastic turn when he meets the gangster Baek Pil-Seung.\n\n*“I’ve never seen anyone who looks like you before. You’re stuck in my head and it’s driving me crazy, what the fuck do I do?”\n“......”\n\"Fucking hell. Fuck me. I'm such a pushover.\"\n“......”\n“I'll protect you. I’ll find your brother.”\n“......”\n“Let’s date.”*\n\nCan the pushover gangster Pil-Seung win over the prickly Woo-Yoon, who’s as difficult as a Maltese?",
